# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of the checking-out platform's default (avoids the
# CRLF/LF phantom-diff noise seen 2026-09-23 - not a content change,
# just inconsistent line endings across the tools/platforms writing to
# this repo).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/generated-image types some contributor might add later -
# never line-ending-normalize these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
